    "metadata": {
      "title": "Global gapless 1 km daily mean land surface temperature dataset (2003-2023)",
      "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17778992",
      "publication_date": "2025-12-01",
      "description": "<p>Daily mean land surface temperature (LST) is a key variable in land&ndash;atmosphere interactions and climate change. We develop a three-step framework integrating empirical, semi-physical, and machine learning approaches for generating a global gapless 1 km daily mean LST dataset spanning 2003&ndash;2023. Validation against worldwide in situ observations demonstrates the product achieving an overall RMSE of 1.838 K and an independent accuracy of 2.073 K.</p>\n<p>Here, sample data are provided in .tif format with a scale factor of 0.01.</p>",
